    },
    {
      "end": 64.27999877929688,
      "text": "Flow OD when the flow on me",
      "start": 61.619998931884766
    },
    {
      "end": 67.5999984741211,
      "text": "Listen, homie, I'm just so OP, I'm just so elite",
      "start": 64.27999877929688
    },
    {
      "end": 70.22000122070312,
      "text": "I'm making y'all sound like you got broken speech",
